khoneycomb (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add portable per-widget configuration backups with bundled custom
    icons and background images, validation and import confirmation.
  * Add a dedicated Backup settings page and Python 3 runtime dependency.
  * Fix theme icon selection on desktops without kiconfinder6.
  * Activate existing application windows on repeated launches.
  * Complete German, Spanish, French and Russian interface translations.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Tue, 20 Oct 2026 11:11:15 +0200

khoneycomb (0.2.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add compact (panel) representation.
  * Add KIconThemes icon picker for the icon field, resolving theme
    names to real paths.
  * Add custom app icon, wired into metadata.json and the hicolor icon
    theme.
  * Add Description[de/es/fr/ru] to metadata.json.
  * Fix: transparent tile placeholder rendered opaque white/black
    instead of the desktop background.

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Mon, 03 Aug 2026 13:20:00 +0200

khoneycomb (0.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First automated .deb/.rpm/.plasmoid release via GitHub Actions.
  * Renamed the plasmoid from the internal working name KHiveLaunch to
    KHoneycomb, matching the repo — the old single-hexagon-per-instance
    KHoneycomb plasmoid is retired, this is now the one and only widget.
  * Configurable background image, adjustable neumorphic 3D bevel,
    grid padding, hover tooltips, drag-to-reorder.
  * Category corrected to "Application Launchers".

 -- Agundur <info@agundur.de>  Mon, 27 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0200
